{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01160",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 7.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.36,
      "end_seconds": 12.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.37,
      "end_seconds": 20.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "Doctor, you know, thank you for seeing us. We came because of a high temperature."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.32,
      "end_seconds": 29.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.93,
      "end_seconds": 45.04,
      "duration_seconds": 14.11,
      "text": "It sort of comes and goes. It feels mild to me. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.77,
      "end_seconds": 50.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Has there been loss of taste too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.44,
      "end_seconds": 54.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.4,
      "end_seconds": 58.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.02,
      "end_seconds": 72.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.06,
      "end_seconds": 102.8,
      "duration_seconds": 12.74,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 37.4 degrees, weight 53 kilos, BMI works out to 19.5, heart rate 94, BP is 129 over 90, height 165 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.17,
      "end_seconds": 106.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Right, may I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.47,
      "end_seconds": 111.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.64,
      "end_seconds": 137.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "Your chest is clear apart from a few crackles at the right base and your oxygen level is a bit low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.21,
      "end_seconds": 144.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.23,
      "end_seconds": 157.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.3,
      "end_seconds": 163.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any leg swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.07,
      "end_seconds": 167.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Any chest pain, confusion, vomiting or diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.62,
      "end_seconds": 180.94,
      "duration_seconds": 12.32,
      "text": "Well, no, no chest pain, no confusion, no vomiting. I was feeling short of breath at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.86,
      "end_seconds": 184.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.01,
      "end_seconds": 186.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.44,
      "end_seconds": 191.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.21,
      "end_seconds": 196.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "No, uh, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.08,
      "end_seconds": 207.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 208.89,
      "end_seconds": 212.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "It's glibenclamide, 5 milligrams, before breakfast, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.38,
      "end_seconds": 216.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 217.77,
      "end_seconds": 224.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "About a month now. It's, It's ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.48,
      "end_seconds": 231.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 232.41,
      "end_seconds": 239.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "For two months. It's Dolo, 650 milligrams, when I get the fever, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.5,
      "end_seconds": 246.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Before this I was on losartan; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.42,
      "end_seconds": 252.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.42,
      "end_seconds": 266.78,
      "duration_seconds": 12.36,
      "text": "Sorry, you know, what was I saying, I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.8,
      "end_seconds": 270.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.78,
      "end_seconds": 275.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.17,
      "end_seconds": 280.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.02,
      "end_seconds": 284.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.07,
      "end_seconds": 289.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.57,
      "end_seconds": 295.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.17,
      "end_seconds": 300.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.39,
      "end_seconds": 307.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Uh, my sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.28,
      "end_seconds": 314.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Alright, what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.97,
      "end_seconds": 321.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Diabetes, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.77,
      "end_seconds": 324.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.75,
      "end_seconds": 328.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.83,
      "end_seconds": 336.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure is known to us, good to have that clear. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.31,
      "end_seconds": 340.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.54,
      "end_seconds": 355.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.28,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with a viral chest infection with mildly low oxygen. Another possibility is a bacterial pneumonia. A viral swab is what I'd like next, for fever and cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 357.89,
      "end_seconds": 362.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "We have a slot Friday at 9 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.06,
      "end_seconds": 378.52,
      "duration_seconds": 14.46,
      "text": "Let's book a chest X-ray to look into low oxygen and crackles. Rest, keep your fluids up and lie on your tummy or side to help your breathing. Book a review in two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.08,
      "end_seconds": 383.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "I can manage that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.1,
      "end_seconds": 389.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.83,
      "end_seconds": 395.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Okay, you know, so no, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.72,
      "end_seconds": 398.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}